  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The total binding energy of nucleus&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>220</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1232</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math></p><p>The total binding energy of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;combined is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>105</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>115</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1408</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math></p><p>Therefore, the energy released per fission is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1408</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1232</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>176</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>MeV</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
